# sid 9500003 removed - indicator false: an earlier local-model ARTEX lab run (juice.pcap) shows the norma WebFetch request with the canonical 'User-Agent' header name; never fired (was in artex-target-facing.rules)
# alert http any any -> any any (msg:"ARTEX/norma WebFetch lower-case user-agent header name"; flow:established,to_server; http.header_names; content:"|0d 0a|user-agent|0d 0a|"; http.user_agent; content:"norma/"; startswith; classtype:attempted-recon; metadata:tool artex, layer target_facing, confidence low, created_at 2026_10_08; sid:9500003; rev:1;)
